==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*20 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 12~13.33 seconds<sup>360f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Croco]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**7 [[Croco]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 8.67~9.33 seconds<sup>260f~280f</sup>.
**4 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

